// Windreach, read off its stones and cloth (NAR-15, docs/story/environment.md). The thing speaks, never a person;
// reading changes nothing. The catalog is `Dressing`.

title: Stones_Notches
---
Stone: Lichen on the north face. On the south face, notches: one for every walk. #still #line:02156b7
Stone: They go back past the Guild's first map. The newest is this year's. #plant:9.2 #still #line:0b18d98
===

title: Camp_WagonCloth
---
Cloth: The route, woven on a wagon's canvas: nine stones, a dry river, a gate, a fire. #still #line:0b13ca1
Cloth: No walls anywhere on it. At every stop, the clan is woven walking. #plant:9.2 #still #line:0c7b95d
===

title: Gate_Lip
---
Stones: A ring of flat stones on the lip. Each is carved with a place, not a name. #still #line:0799b32
Stones: "The Long Grass." "The Dry River." "Where the Star Fell." The young stand on them to jump. #still #line:097f87c
===
